[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5824.99, "timestamp": "01:37:04", "text": "那里。创造回忆，去玩吧。啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5827.35, "timestamp": "01:37:07", "text": "是的。但是，如果你要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5829.75, "timestamp": "01:37:09", "text": "半夜唱卡拉OK，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5831.189, "timestamp": "01:37:11", "text": "附近任何一家办事处你都会看到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5833.59, "timestamp": "01:37:13", "text": "很多联合体的人都吐得昏天黑地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5836.79, "timestamp": "01:37:16", "text": "嗯，你不用帮他们，好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5838.709, "timestamp": "01:37:18", "text": "对他们来说，这很正常。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5841.83, "timestamp": "01:37:21", "text": "呕吐和被自己的呕吐物呛到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5843.27, "timestamp": "01:37:23", "text": "对他们来说，这很正常，尤其如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5846.07, "timestamp": "01:37:26", "text": "周末期间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5848.79, "timestamp": "01:37:28", "text": "他们喝醉了之类的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5851.79, "timestamp": "01:37:31", "text": "好的，我能理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5854.629, "timestamp": "01:37:34", "text": "是的，如果你是的话，对公司来说就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5855.83, "timestamp": "01:37:35", "text": "你要去喝酒，你要去喝一杯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5857.35, "timestamp": "01:37:37", "text": "很多。当你……呃……当……就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5859.189, "timestamp": "01:37:39", "text": "就像老板给你提供……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5862.47, "timestamp": "01:37:42", "text": "酒精，你必须，你必须摄入"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5863.4, "timestamp": "01:37:43", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hey hey joqqy UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/G8AfY6yWGuKuhL0PlbiA2AEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg how u doin"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5864.149, "timestamp": "01:37:44", "text": "你可以说不，但那样就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5866.31, "timestamp": "01:37:46", "text": "喜欢喝任何东西都好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5868.709, "timestamp": "01:37:48", "text": "他们会给你。所以，我大概可以算是吧。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5868.894, "timestamp": "01:37:48", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "meanwhile saiko does interview in middle of shibuya"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5870.87, "timestamp": "01:37:50", "text": "理解他们。感谢上帝，我的老板"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5874.31, "timestamp": "01:37:54", "text": "没让我喝得烂醉。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5875.354, "timestamp": "01:37:55", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Joq senpai bring back yaoi manga for thaiko 🤣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5877.83, "timestamp": "01:37:57", "text": "所以，有趣的是，就像……所以我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.91, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "老板说我们有三个"}]